---
interface Props{id:string}
const {id}=Astro.props;
---
<section data-interactions={id} aria-label="文章互动"><div class="article-actions"><button data-like aria-pressed="false">点赞</button><button data-egg-open>臭鸡蛋</button><button data-article-bookmark aria-pressed="false">收藏</button><a class="button" href="#comments">评论</a><details class="more-actions"><summary>更多</summary><button data-share>分享链接</button></details></div><p class="muted" data-article-stats>正在查看文章互动…</p><dialog id="egg-dialog" aria-labelledby="egg-title"><form method="dialog"><button class="dialog-close" aria-label="关闭投掷面板">关闭</button></form><h2 id="egg-title">给文章扔臭鸡蛋</h2><p data-egg-wallet>正在打开钱包…</p><form id="egg-form"><label>投掷数量<input name="quantity" type="number" min="1" max="50" value="1" required /></label><div class="article-actions"><button type="button" data-quantity="1">扔 1 枚</button><button type="button" data-quantity="5">扔 5 枚</button><button>按数量投掷</button></div></form><p data-egg-result role="status"></p><p class="muted">只面向文章内容，可以重复投掷；点赞和臭鸡蛋互不冲突。</p></dialog></section>
<script>import '../scripts/article-interactions';</script>
